coach "Air Raid"
about "Spread them out and throw it forty times. Goes for it on fourth and short."

offense:
  when game ending and leading by over 0 and clock under 100 -> kneel
  when fourth down and to go under 4 and past midfield -> call "Slants" or "Mesh"
  when fourth down and to go over 6 -> call "Four Verticals" or "Smash" or "Mesh"
  when fourth down -> call "Slants" or "Inside Zone" or "Curl Flat"
  when third down and to go over 8 -> call "Four Verticals" or "Smash"
  when first down and chance 30% -> call "Four Verticals"
  when to go under 2 and chance 40% -> call "Inside Zone"
  otherwise -> call "Slants" or "Mesh" or "Smash" or "Curl Flat" or "RB Screen" or "Four Verticals"

defense:
  when third down -> call "Cover 1" or "Cover 0 Blitz"
  otherwise -> call "Cover 2" or "Cover 3"

lineup:
  QB "Gunslinger"
  RB "Scatback"
  WR "Burner"
  WR3 "Route Runner"
  TE "Receiving TE"
  OL "Pass Protector"
  DL "Speed Rusher"
  LB "Coverage LB"
  CB "Ball Hawk"
  S "Center Fielder"
